---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Will checking my rate hurt my credit score?',
    a: 'No. Checking your rate through LendPath uses a soft credit inquiry, which does not affect your credit score. Only if you choose to proceed with a lender and formally apply will they conduct a hard pull.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is LendPath a lender?',
    a: 'No. LendPath is a loan marketplace that connects you with a network of lenders. We do not make lending decisions or fund loans. All lending terms are determined by the individual lender you choose.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How much can I borrow?',
    a: 'Through our lender network, loan amounts typically range from $1,000 to $5,000. The amount you qualify for will depend on your creditworthiness, income, and the policies of individual lenders.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What are the interest rates?',
    a: 'APRs in our network range from approximately 5.90% to 34.99% depending on your credit profile, loan amount, and term. Repayment terms range from 6 to 72 months. Your actual rate will be disclosed before you commit to any offer.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How long does the process take?',
    a: 'Completing the form takes about 2 minutes. Pre-qualified offers typically appear instantly or within a few minutes. From there, the final approval process with your chosen lender varies.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What can I use a personal loan for?',
    a: 'Loan offers from our network can be used for debt consolidation, home improvements, medical expenses, major purchases, and more. Some lenders may have restrictions — check the offer terms before accepting.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is my personal information safe?',
    a: 'Yes. We use 256-bit SSL encryption to protect your data. We share your information only with lenders in our network for the purpose of matching you with loan offers, as described in our Privacy Policy.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Am I obligated to accept an offer?',
    a: 'Absolutely not. Checking your options through LendPath is free and non-binding. You can review all offers and walk away at any time without any cost or obligation.',
  },
];
---

<section id="faq" class="py-20 md:py-28" style="background: var(--surface-2);" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
      <p class="section-label mb-3">FAQ</p>
      <h2 id="faq-heading" class="text-3xl font-extrabold sm:text-4xl" style="color: #f1f5f9; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
        Common Questions
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3" role="list">
      {faqs.map((item, i) => (
        <details
          class="faq-item card py-0 overflow-hidden"
          role="listitem"
        >
          <summary
            class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 text-sm font-semibold text-white select-none"
            aria-expanded="false"
          >
            <span>{item.q}</span>
            <svg
              class="faq-chevron ml-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"
              width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M4.5 6.75L9 11.25L13.5 6.75" stroke="#8892a4" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-body px-6 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            {item.a}
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq-item[open] .faq-chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }
  .faq-item[open] summary { color: #f1f5f9; }
</style>
